# Stilwell Farms -- the horse and the rider (farm-only sprite set: shares VRAM with the townsfolk)
# Horse colours follow the breed palettes: 1 coat, 2 mane/tail/hooves, 3 outline:
#   ANIMAL = White (tan mane), BREEDRARE = Chestnut (flaxen mane), BREEDGOLD = Palomino.
# HORSE_SIDE faces left (the engine mirrors it); SIDE2 is the stride frame.
# RIDER_* is the farmer in the saddle, drawn a few pixels above the horse.

